WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:24.917
"Bye, Ethan! Have a great first day at your after-school program!" Mr. Frick said.

2
00:00:24.918 --> 00:00:33.887
He waved as Ethan walked into the gym.

3
00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:40.242
"You must be Ethan," Miss Shelly said with a big smile.

4
00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:46.122
"Welcome to Kids Central!"

5
00:00:46.123 --> 00:00:50.290
Ethan saw two girls sitting at the table, trading beads.

6
00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:52.622
They looked up and stared at him.

7
00:00:52.623 --> 00:00:56.283
Two boys were playing basketball in a corner of the gym.

8
00:00:56.284 --> 00:01:03.022
They stopped and stared at him too.

9
00:01:03.023 --> 00:01:06.361
"A new kid?" one of the boys said.

10
00:01:06.362 --> 00:01:09.346
"Ethan, meet Nina and Izzie.

11
00:01:09.347 --> 00:01:11.257
They're in third grade.

12
00:01:11.258 --> 00:01:13.996
And this is Bobby and Jason.

13
00:01:13.997 --> 00:01:17.905
They're in fourth grade, like you!" Miss Shelly said.

14
00:01:17.906 --> 00:01:22.598
"Ethan just moved from California," she told everyone.

15
00:01:22.599 --> 00:01:25.581
"Hi," the boys said together.

16
00:01:25.582 --> 00:01:29.272
"You're really tan," Jason said.

17
00:01:29.273 --> 00:01:34.437
"It's warm and sunny all year in southern California."

18
00:01:34.438 --> 00:01:37.557
Ethan looked out the window and frowned.

19
00:01:37.558 --> 00:01:39.479
"Not like here."

20
00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:44.698
"We’re going to make Kids Central scrapbooks today!" Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:44.699 --> 00:01:49.687
"Every day we do a new activity together," she explained to Ethan.

22
00:01:49.688 --> 00:01:54.290
"It's fun!" said Nina.

23
00:01:54.291 --> 00:02:00.445
"Today we'll make scrapbooks that you can fill in during the year," Miss Shelly said.

24
00:02:00.446 --> 00:02:06.025
"First choose a long piece of construction paper for the front and back of your book.

25
00:02:06.026 --> 00:02:07.999
Fold it in half.

26
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.550
Then write the year and 'Kids Central' on the front."

27
00:02:12.551 --> 00:02:15.534
Jason and Bobby both chose orange.

28
00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:18.041
But Ethan chose blue.

29
00:02:18.042 --> 00:02:23.125
"Blue is my favorite color because it's the color of the ocean," Ethan said.

30
00:02:23.126 --> 00:02:28.811
"In California I used to surf every day after school!" He paused.

31
00:02:28.812 --> 00:02:32.449
"But there's no ocean in Pennsylvania."

32
00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:37.109
"But Pennsylvania has other fun things," Bobby said.

33
00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:44.467
"Now choose six pieces of the smaller paper for the inside pages," Miss Shelly said.

34
00:02:44.468 --> 00:02:50.922
"Put them in your folded cover, and staple the folded side.

35
00:02:50.923 --> 00:02:56.037
Glue this All About Me sheet on the first page."

36
00:02:56.038 --> 00:02:59.535
"My favorite food is tacos!" Ethan said.

37
00:02:59.536 --> 00:03:02.411
"Will we make tacos at Kids Central?"

38
00:03:02.412 --> 00:03:06.660
"Yeah! Let's make tacos!" Izzie said.

39
00:03:06.661 --> 00:03:13.685
"Maybe we could. We do cook a lot," Miss Shelly said.

40
00:03:13.686 --> 00:03:19.288
"The next page will be your September page," Miss Shelly went on.

41
00:03:19.289 --> 00:03:24.349
"Use these alphabet stickers to spell 'September' across the top.

42
00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:29.805
This month you can draw pictures or write about what happened in school."

43
00:03:29.806 --> 00:03:35.578
"I'm going to write about Ethan, the new boy with blue shorts," Izzie said.

44
00:03:35.579 --> 00:03:37.701
She pointed at Ethan.

45
00:03:37.702 --> 00:03:41.780
"It is not nice to point, Izzie," Miss Shelly said.

46
00:03:41.781 --> 00:03:46.477
"I'll write about my first day at Kids Central," Ethan said.

47
00:03:46.478 --> 00:03:53.558
"Great ideas! Next make one page for each month until June," Miss Shelly said.

48
00:03:53.559 --> 00:03:57.677
"You can fill in the other pages during the year."

49
00:03:57.678 --> 00:04:00.391
"Miss Shelly, there's one extra page.

50
00:04:00.392 --> 00:04:03.955
What's it for?" Ethan asked.

51
00:04:03.956 --> 00:04:06.988
"It should be the Friends page.

52
00:04:06.989 --> 00:04:11.921
We can sign our names on each other's scrapbooks!" Bobby said.

53
00:04:11.922 --> 00:04:17.823
"Cool idea," Ethan said, smiling. "Will you sign mine?"

54
00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:21.736
"Sure," Bobby said.

55
00:04:21.737 --> 00:04:24.164
"Gather together, everyone.

56
00:04:24.165 --> 00:04:28.867
We're going to take a photo for your scrapbooks," Miss Shelly said.

57
00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:31.056
"It will go on the cover."

58
00:04:31.057 --> 00:04:33.318
The kids gathered together.

59
00:04:33.319 --> 00:04:36.095
Miss Shelly set the timer on the camera.

60
00:04:36.096 --> 00:04:46.919
She ran behind them just in time. "Cheese!"

61
00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:58.658
[caption_out@
